        <UserObject label="+---------------------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Profile.js&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;+---------------------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;| 1. **DOMContentLoaded Event Listener**&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Waits for the DOM to be fully loaded before executing the code. |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Fetches profile data from `/website-wallet/server(api)/php/profileData.php`. |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - If data contains error (e.g., user not logged in), redirects to `login.html`. |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - If successful:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; + Updates profile details:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Username, Email, Phone, Address&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Balance (defaults to `$1` if no balance found) |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Greeting message with username&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - If an error occurs while fetching data, displays an error message in `.profile-body`. |&lt;br&gt;+---------------------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;| 2. **Logout Functionality**&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Listens for a click event on the **logout** button. |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Makes a request to `/website-wallet/server(api)/php/logout.php`. |&lt;br&gt;|&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Redirects to `login.html` after logging out.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;|&lt;br&gt;+---------------------------------------------------+" link="+---------------------------------------------------+&#xa;|                 Profile Page Flow                 |&#xa;+---------------------------------------------------+&#xa;| 1. **DOMContentLoaded Event Listener**             |&#xa;|    - Waits for the DOM to be fully loaded before executing the code. |&#xa;|    - Fetches profile data from `/website-wallet/server(api)/php/profileData.php`. |&#xa;|    - If data contains error (e.g., user not logged in), redirects to `login.html`. |&#xa;|    - If successful:                                 |&#xa;|      + Updates profile details:                      |&#xa;|         - Username, Email, Phone, Address           |&#xa;|         - Balance (defaults to `$1` if no balance found) |&#xa;|         - Greeting message with username           |&#xa;|    - If an error occurs while fetching data, displays an error message in `.profile-body`. |&#xa;+---------------------------------------------------+&#xa;| 2. **Logout Functionality**                        |&#xa;|    - Listens for a click event on the **logout** button. |&#xa;|    - Makes a request to `/website-wallet/server(api)/php/logout.php`. |&#xa;|    - Redirects to `login.html` after logging out.   |&#xa;+---------------------------------------------------+" id="sxZ-Bx4f5nurjPwKOAeU-34">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1310" y="190" width="200" height="600" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
